{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17680","headline":"题赵孟庄 · 杨巨源","name":"题赵孟庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"管鲍化爲尘，交友存如线。\n升堂俱自媚，得路难相见。\n懿君敦三益，颓俗期一变。\n心同袭芝兰，气合回霜霰。\n石门云卧久，玉洞花寻遍。\n王濬爱旌旗，梁竦劳州县。\n烟鸿秋更远，天马寒愈健。\n愿事郭先生，青囊书几卷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17680.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17680","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}